<!-- Android 12+ launch icon. The system draws it 288dp square and masks it to
     a 192dp circle, so the emblem is 152dp (inset 68dp, 23.6%, on each side):
     the size BrandSplashScreen draws it, and small enough that the corners of
     its cloud base stay inside the circle. -->
